{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:11 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:11 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:11 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"膠袋廠地舖發生火警。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/b8e04acfa6df8109f2d08d621c09889a/2026-11/page_26.jpg\"/><p>深水埗一間膠袋舖發生火警。今晨（3日）9時27分，警方接獲多個報案，指汝州街222號地舖的膠袋廠起火冒煙。消防到場出動一喉一煙帽隊灌救，約10分鐘將火救熄。其間有5人自行疏散，火警中無人受傷。據知起火位置是舖頭後巷，消防正調查火警原因。</p><img alt=\"消防到場灌救。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d751ba21d4104671a9879f21a8d9289b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_58_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"人員將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/90da075ca015dff6b9c4d570f3d7af74/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_56_47.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3ffcb31c6be1352951b6ffd00c8924b5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_56_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"膠袋廠地舖發生火警。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/337f952a7803b865dcdc4bce9f847090/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_56_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"人員在場調查火警原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/528c1031d5880f12b26a307b405474fe/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_56_50.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e7c42761a59bd11cd9dd54fbb38daecb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_56_49_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/419f7c45d832768afeef6a5439abcb87/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_56_49_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/16a17249f8559fa4c5b677595b20426c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_09_56_47_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:01.992808+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:11:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:02:51.010181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:10.727573+00:00","content_hash":"c3d904af7b9